---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<SiteLayout active="home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> INDEPENDENT THINKER · BUILDER · CREATOR</p>
      <h1>Technology is most powerful when it <em>moves people forward.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">I’m Kastine Augak — a technology enthusiast, software builder, entrepreneur and creative from Uganda. I explore ideas and turn them into useful digital experiences.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href={base + 'biography/'}>Explore my story <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="mailto:kastineaugak@gmail.com">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
      <div class="hero-meta"><span><i></i> Based in Fort Portal, Uganda</span><span>Technology · Research · Media</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="orbit-core">KA</div><span class="orbit-tag tag-one">BUILD</span><span class="orbit-tag tag-two">LEARN</span><span class="orbit-tag tag-three">SHARE</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="intro-strip"><p>CURIOUS BY NATURE. PRACTICAL BY DESIGN.</p><span>Working across software, digital products, research and storytelling.</span></section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE WORK</p><h2>Where ideas meet <em>execution.</em></h2></div><p class="section-note">A growing collection of interests and workstreams — connected by a belief in useful, accessible technology.</p></div>
    <div class="work-grid">
      <article class="work-card"><span class="card-index">01 / SOFTWARE</span><div class="card-symbol">⌘</div><h3>Software & digital products</h3><p>Building practical websites, mobile-first tools and digital experiences with real people and real constraints in mind.</p><a href={base + 'biography/#ventures'}>Explore the work <span>↗</span></a></article>
      <article class="work-card"><span class="card-index">02 / RESEARCH</span><div class="card-symbol">⌁</div><h3>Research & learning</h3><p>Exploring language technology, data, AI and the ways digital tools can support learning and local knowledge.</p><a href={base + 'biography/#research'}>Explore the interests <span>↗</span></a></article>
      <article class="work-card"><span class="card-index">03 / MEDIA</span><div class="card-symbol">◉</div><h3>Digital media & storytelling</h3><p>Communicating ideas through writing, visual media, music and conversations about technology.</p><a href={base + 'blog/'}>Visit the journal <span>↗</span></a></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="feature-band"><div><p class="eyebrow">AUGAK · UGANDA</p><h2>Local perspective.<br/><em>Open horizons.</em></h2></div><p>Technology should not only look impressive. It should load quickly, make sense on an affordable phone, respect people’s data and solve a problem worth solving.</p></section>
  <section class="section split-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE</p><h2>One person.<br/><em>Many directions.</em></h2></div><div><p class="body-large">My interests move between engineering, entrepreneurship, research and creative work. This site brings those threads together — a place to understand what I do, what I’m learning and what I’m building.</p><a class="button button-outline" href={base + 'biography/'}>Read the biography <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="contact-band"><div><p class="eyebrow">HAVE AN IDEA OR A QUESTION?</p><h2>Let’s make something <em>useful.</em></h2></div><a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:kastineaugak@gmail.com">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a></section>
</SiteLayout>